---Defines a connection analyzer resource.
---@class azure.network.ConnectionAnalyzer
---@field name? string Name of the connection analyzer.
---@field id? string Resource ID of the connection analyzer.
---@field type? string Resource type.
---@field etag? string A unique read-only string that changes whenever the resource is updated.
---@field location string Resource location.
---@field tags? azure.network.ConnectionAnalyzerTagsMap Resource tags.
---@field systemData? azure.network.ConnectionAnalyzerSystemData Metadata pertaining to creation and last modification of the resource.
