---Properties of the load balancer.
---@class azure.network.LoadBalancerPropertiesFormat
---@field frontendIPConfigurations? azure.network.LoadBalancerPropertiesFormatFrontendIPConfigurationsList Object representing the frontend IPs to be used for the load balancer.
---@field backendAddressPools? azure.network.LoadBalancerPropertiesFormatBackendAddressPoolsList Collection of backend address pools used by a load balancer.
---@field loadBalancingRules? azure.network.LoadBalancerPropertiesFormatLoadBalancingRulesList Object collection representing the load balancing rules Gets the provisioning.
