---@field sessionTimeLimitInSeconds? number Maximum duration of the capture session in seconds is 604800s (7 days) for a file. Default value in second 86400s (1 day).

---The storage location for a packet capture session.
---@class azure.network.PacketCaptureStorageLocation
---@field storageId? string The ID of the storage account to save the packet capture session. Required if no localPath or filePath is provided.
---@field storagePath? string The URI of the storage path to save the packet capture. Must be a well-formed URI describing the location to save the packet capture.
---@field filePath? string This path is invalid if 'Continuous Capture' is provided with 'true' or 'false'. A valid local path on the targeting VM. Must include the name of the capture file (*.cap). For linux virtual machine it must start with /var/captures. Required if no storage ID is provided, otherwise optional.
---@field localPath? string This path is valid if 'Continuous Capture' is provided with 'true' or 'false' and required if no storage ID is provided, otherwise optional. Must include the name of the capture file (*.cap). For linux virtual machine it must start with /var/captures.

